// Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded hyperbolic tangent of F16
//
// x = x1 + x2 (see HypTables.tess): sinh(x) and cosh(x) from F32 tables, each
// with one fused multiply-add, and tanh(x) as their quotient. Near 0 tanh(x)
// rounds to x, and for |x| >= 0x1.208p+2 to ±1. Round to nearest only: ±inf
// gives ±1, NaN comes back quiet.
//
// Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binary16/tanh/tanhf16.c via RazorForge's B16Tanh.rf.
// Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
// MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

